<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on CS Group.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on CS Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of CS Group.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    199.0 CHF		 PREMIUM	16.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.96 CHF		  GEARING	18.6 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 28.MAY.97-15.APR.98   PAYDATE	28.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  179.0 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
